  <Thumbnail>cb124cfd-ea24-4af0-89ad-88df82bc5860</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="18-07-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="02-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Updated to spec" />
  <History Date="19-11-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited corrected Gobo 2 Func" />
  <History Date="19-11-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited corrected iris locate to 0%" />
  <History Date="28-01-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Corrected Gobo function channels." />
  <History Date="19-04-13" Author="RDM Sync Tool" Comment="Added RDM Manufacturer information. Added RDM Fixture information. Added RDM Mode information." />
  <History Date="24-07-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from the Mac Viper Profile." />
  <History Date="30-06-14" Author="stephen harris" Comment="Edited to update gobo rot resolution so 16bit rather than 0-255 on wheels" />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased wheel resolution for Gobo 1 Rot spin ranges, shutter strobe, zoom, focus, effect and prism rot ranges." />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed Gobo 1 Rot raw range to 65535.  Fixed Colour Func update so that raw colour function would work." />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed shutter pulse palettes to random to match associated functions." />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added physical pan/tilt limits.  Changed Blade All Rot range to +/- 55 degrees." />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed gobo shake ranges from fixed to percentage.  Fixed spelling of 'continuous' in effect." />
  <History Date="01-07-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised gobo scroll wheel direction.  Added colour function index." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="16-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Martin Mac Viper Performance" />
  <History Date="20-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed minor error on Col Wheel Rnd Split Step effect range.  Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="20-09-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Inverted animation spin CCW range in line with documentation (130-253 = fast-&gt;slow)." />
  <History Date="13-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Split from Martin MAC Encore Performance for Capture." />
  <History Date="13-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail" />
  <History Date="13-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo swatches" />
  <History Date="13-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Martin Mac Encore Performance WRM" />
  <History Date="15-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
